  "description": "Ride a smarter hybrid bike built for city streets and beyond Built for daily efficiency and weekend freedom, this bike combines 700×35C lightweight all-terrain tires with a responsive frame geometry that keeps city rides smooth and light gravel routes steady. The lightweight aluminum alloy frame supports reliable strength without adding bulk, while front and rear caliper brakes offers controlled stopping when traffic, corners, or changing surfaces demand quick response. A Shimano 18-speed drivetrain gives this adult bicycle easy gear changes for flat streets, casual fitness rides, and short climbs. Adjustable contact points improve fit across a wide rider range, and the included kickstand, reflectors, non-slip pedals, and phone holder make this commuter bike practical for everyday use. With 85% pre-assembly, it also offers a convenient setup for riders seeking a versatile hybrid bike feel with urban comfort.",
